desc(
	mode: "source"
	language: "general"
	title: "Ocamllint Digest"
	title_zh: "Ocamllint Digest"
	type: vuln
	level: middle
	rule_id: "source-insecure-api-ocamllint-digest"
	risk: "weak-hash"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 规则说明
Digest uses MD5 and should not be used for security purposes. Consider using SHA256 instead.

### 风险类型
弱哈希算法（weak-hash）

### 影响
使用 MD5、SHA-1 等弱哈希算法，可能被碰撞或暴力破解。

### 检测方式
Source 模式正则匹配，检测代码或配置中符合该风险模式的位置。

### 补充说明
Note: source-mode regex approximation of a safe-literal pattern.

### 参考
- CWE: CWE-328: Use of Weak Hash (4.12)
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 修复建议
改用 SHA-256/SHA-3 或针对口令使用 bcrypt/Argon2 等专用算法。

推荐修复：
Consider using SHA256 instead.
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	"file://pos.ml": <<<POS
Digest.string
POS
	"safefile://pos.ml": <<<NEG
Digestif.SHA256.digest
NEG
)

${*.ml}.pattern_regex(/(?:Digest\.string)|(?:Digest\.bytes)|(?:Digest\.substring)|(?:Digest\.subbytes)|(?:Digest\.channel)|(?:Digest\.file)/) as $p0
${*.mli}.pattern_regex(/(?:Digest\.string)|(?:Digest\.bytes)|(?:Digest\.substring)|(?:Digest\.subbytes)|(?:Digest\.channel)|(?:Digest\.file)/) as $p1
$p0 + $p1 as $hit
alert $hit for {
	level: "middle",
	title: "Ocamllint Digest",
	title_zh: "Ocamllint Digest",
	message: "Ocamllint Digest detected.",
}
